ldren":"A current balance is used for a historical date"}]]}],["$","tr","4",{"children":[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Authentication"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Translation and legalisation/apostille route"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"A stamp is on the wrong document"}]]}]]}]]}]}],"$undefined"],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]
20:["$","section","Keep three dates separate",{"id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Keep three dates separate"}],[["$","p","Write down the deadline for the online benefit application, the deadline for submitting financial evidence and any deadline for correcting a deficient file. A later document-upload date does not necessarily extend the original scholarship application.",{"children":"Write down the deadline for the online benefit application, the deadline for submitting financial evidence and any deadline for correcting a deficient file. A later document-upload date does not necessarily extend the original scholarship application."}],["$","p","As an ER.GO example, its official instructions ask for current-year issued documentation describing the previous year's income and year-end assets. Reopen the annual call before ordering records; do not reuse this example as a national rule.",{"children":"As an ER.GO example, its official instructions ask for current-year issued documentation describing the previous year's income and year-end assets. Reopen the annual call before ordering records; do not reuse this example as a national rule."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
21:["$","section","A practical sequence for your family",{"id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"A practical sequence for your family"}],[["$","p","First make an inventory of available records. Next send a concise question to the authorised office about any missing category. Only then obtain the required versions, arrange accepted translation/authentication, upload through the stated route and save the confirmation.",{"children":"First make an inventory of available records. Next send a concise question to the authorised office about any missing category. Only then obtain the required versions, arrange accepted translation/authentication, upload through the stated route and save the confirmation."}],["$","p","Use consistent passport names across the file. If records use an older spelling, explain it through the accepted evidence instead of changing an official scan. Keep a simple log showing issuer, issue date, reference year, translation status and upload receipt.",{"children":"Use consistent passport names across the file. If records use an older spelling, explain it through the accepted evidence instead of changing an official scan. Keep a simple log showing issuer, issue date, reference year, translation status and upload receipt."}]],"$undefined",["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","One folder per application year.",{"children":"One folder per application year."}],["$","li","One row per document, with the person it relates to.",{"children":"One row per document, with the person it relates to."}],["$","li","One unresolved-question list for the authority.",{"children":"One unresolved-question list for the authority."}],["$","li","No passwords or unnecessary bank documents sent to strangers.",{"children":"No passwords or unnecessary bank documents sent to strangers."}]]}],"$undefined"]}]
22:["$","section","Zero income and independence are not shortcuts",{"id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Zero income and independence are not shortcuts"}],[["$","p","Zero earnings are different from zero assets. A family member can have no salary while holding savings or property. Declare the full position in the format the authority requires.",{"children":"Zero earnings are different from zero assets. A family member can have no salary while holding savings or property. Declare the full position in the format the authority requires."}],["$","p","Living away from your parents is not, by itself, proof of financial independence. Ask for the published independence test and keep evidence for every condition. Do not omit the parental household just because you currently rent a room elsewhere.",{"children":"Living away from your parents is not, by itself, proof of financial independence. Ask for the published independence test and keep evidence for every condition. Do not omit the parental household just because you currently rent a room elsewhere."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
23:["$","section","After submission: follow the file, not just the ranking",{"id":"section-7","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"After submission: follow the file, not just the ranking"}],[["$","p","Check the official portal and inbox for clarification requests. Save the submitted application and final assessment separately. If a document is rejected, ask what defect needs correcting and whether a correction period is still available.",{"children":"Check the official portal and inbox for clarification requests. Save the submitted application and final assessment separately. If a document is rejected, ask what defect needs correcting and whether a correction period is still available."}],["$","p","Build a budget that works while the decision is pending. An economic assessment can support an application; it does not promise a grant, an available room or an immediate payment.",{"children":"Build a budget that works while the decision is pending. An economic assessment can support an application; it does not promise a grant, an available room or an immediate payment."}]],"$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for After submission: follow the file, not just the ranking","children":[["$","$L3","/tools/italy-study-cost-calculator/",{"href":"/tools/italy-study-cost-calculator/","children":["Estimate the funding gap",["$","$L4",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$e:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L3","/guides/university-of-padua-admissions-scholarships/",{"href":"/guides/university-of-padua-admissions-scholarships/","children":["Padua application guide",["$","$L4",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$e:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L3","/guides/university-of-bologna-admissions-scholarships/",{"href":"/guides/university-of-bologna-admissions-scholarships/","children":["Bologna application guide",["$","$L4",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$e:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
